# ============================================================
#  Tracks (design §7): courses, clubs, jobs, internships and the
#  thesis as one progression system. The reduced list of §7.1
#  (decision D4). Data only until phase 2b; today's electives,
#  clubs and jobs are still the `class_*`, `club_*` and `job_*`
#  states in content/states/states.grim.
#  legacy: the old states a track stands for (phase 2b compat: joining
#  grants them, so their events keep firing) · opens: the first term a
#  course is offered (default 1).
# ============================================================

# ---------------- Courses: 6 disciplines × 3 levels ----------------

@track evocation
kind: course
name: Evocation
skill: arcana
levels: 3
level_names: Evocation I, Evocation II, Advanced Evocation
place: lecture_tower
teaches: flame@1 flame@2 tide@2 flame@3 tide@3
lead: thorne
intro: thorne_intro
desc: Fire and water, called up and held. Pyromancy and Tidecalling, taught together because they keep putting each other out.
picked: You sign up for Evocation. The reading list comes with a note about singed eyebrows.

@track astromancy
kind: course
name: Astromancy & Divination
skill: lore
levels: 3
level_names: Astromancy I, Astromancy II, Advanced Astromancy
place: observatory
teaches: foresight@1 foresight@2 starlight@2 foresight@3 starlight@3
desc: Reading the sky and the time that hasn't happened yet. Tea leaves in the first year; star charts that move in the third.
picked: You sign up for Astromancy. Someone hands you a teacup and tells you not to drink from it.

@track alchemy
kind: course
name: Alchemy & Healing
skill: alchemy
levels: 3
level_names: Alchemy I, Alchemy II, Advanced Alchemy
place: alchemy_lab
teaches: mend@1 mend@2 purify@2 mend@3 purify@3
lead: amaranth
intro: amaranth_intro
desc: Potions, remedies and the patience to stir clockwise. Half of it happens in the laboratory and half in the infirmary.
picked: You sign up for Alchemy. Your first lesson is how to stir clockwise, and why.

@track illusion
kind: course
name: Illusion & Glamour
skill: charm
levels: 3
level_names: Illusion I, Illusion II, Advanced Illusion
place: lecture_tower
teaches: glamour@1 glamour@2 mirror@2 glamour@3 mirror@3
lead: vey
intro: vey_intro
desc: Making people see what you choose. Professor Vey grades on whether you fooled her, and she is very hard to fool.
picked: You sign up for Illusion. Professor Vey looks at you as if you might already be one.

@track beastcraft
kind: course
name: Beastcraft & Flight
skill: vigor
levels: 3
level_names: Beastcraft I, Beastcraft II, Advanced Beastcraft
place: stables
teaches: haste@1 haste@2 beast_speech@2 haste@3 beast_speech@3
opens: 2
lead: brask
intro: brask_intro
desc: Creatures, familiars and brooms. Professor Brask believes the first two are easier to reason with than the third.
picked: You sign up for Beastcraft. Your name goes on the list beside a broom and a hippogriff.

@track umbral
kind: course
name: Umbral Theory
skill: guile
levels: 3
level_names: Umbral Theory I, Umbral Theory II, Advanced Umbral Theory
place: lecture_tower
teaches: ward@1 ward@2 shadowstep@2 ward@3 shadowstep@3
opens: 2
desc: Shadow, wards and the magic of what is hidden. Taught at the top of the tower, where the lamps burn dim on purpose.
picked: You sign up for Umbral Theory. The lamps at the top of the tower are dim on purpose.

# ---------------- Hidden courses ----------------

@track artifice
kind: course
name: Artifice
skill: alchemy arcana
levels: 1
# taken late, after level II–III elsewhere: its classwork is pitched at expert (docs/authoring/checks.md)
standard: expert
level_names: Artifice
place: workshop
hidden: true
prereq: passed(alchemy, 2) and passed(evocation, 2)
desc: Enchanted machinery: clockwork that thinks, cauldrons that stir themselves. Offered to students who already know how to make things and how to make them burn.
picked: You take the place in Artifice. Someone shows you where the fire buckets are before anything else.

@track starcalling
kind: course
name: Starcalling
skill: lore arcana
levels: 1
# taken late, after level II–III elsewhere: its classwork is pitched at expert (docs/authoring/checks.md)
standard: expert
level_names: Starcalling
place: observatory
hidden: true
prereq: passed(astromancy, 3) and clue(heard_of_starcalling)
desc: Calling down the light of a named star. Not on any syllabus; taught by appointment, at night.
picked: You accept the appointment for Starcalling. The first one is tonight.

@track hollow_studies
kind: course
name: Hollow Studies
skill: guile lore
levels: 1
# taken late, after level II–III elsewhere: its classwork is pitched at expert (docs/authoring/checks.md)
standard: expert
level_names: Hollow Studies
place: restricted_section
hidden: true
prereq: passed(umbral, 2) and passed(astromancy, 2) and clue(knows_founders_seal)
desc: What the founders sealed, and how. The headmistress teaches it herself, to very few students, in a room without windows.
picked: You accept a seat in Hollow Studies. The headmistress writes your name in a book with a black cover.

# ---------------- Clubs (one at a time) ----------------

@track duelling
kind: club
name: Duelling Circle
skill: arcana vigor
place: duel_hall
ranks: Member, Officer, Captain
due: 2
lead: lyra
intro: lyra_intro
desc: Practice bouts, the Spring Tournament and a great deal of shouting about footwork.
picked: You join the Duelling Circle. Someone is already explaining footwork to you, loudly.

@track lumen_ledger
kind: club
name: The Lumen Ledger
skill: charm lore
place: ledger_office
ranks: Stringer, Reporter, Editor
due: 2
lead: nessa
intro: nessa_intro
desc: The student newspaper. Scoops, deadlines, gossip columns and the occasional duty to the truth.
picked: You join the Lumen Ledger. Nessa hands you a notebook and your first deadline.

@track verdant
kind: club
name: Verdant Circle
skill: alchemy
place: greenhouses
ranks: Member, Gardener, Head Gardener
due: 2
lead: tobias
intro: tobias_intro
desc: The greenhouse club: moonflowers, mandrakes and long talks with plants that occasionally answer.
picked: You join the Verdant Circle. Tobias introduces you to the plants, one by one.

# A society (playtest 2, M40): a hidden flavour group with no dues, performance or ranks, beside your club.
@track cartographers
kind: society
name: Midnight Cartographers
skill: guile
place: gargoyle_passage
hidden: true
lead: corvin
intro: corvin_intro
desc: The club that doesn't exist, mapping the passages the castle would prefer to keep. Never offered at the Club Fair; you are invited, or you aren't.

# ---------------- Jobs (one at a time) ----------------
# Pay per full shift by rank (L-1): one base, 15 / 21 / 27, with the hazardous jobs (the Newt's nights, the courier's
# flights) a quarter above it and the quiet ones (the library, the apothecary's counter) a fifth below.

@track library_assistant
kind: job
name: Library Assistant
skill: lore
place: library
ranks: Apprentice, Clerk, Senior Clerk
pay: 12, 17, 22
due: 3
desc: Shelving books that don't want to be shelved, and keeping Footnote off the reference desk.
picked: You sign on at the library. Your first shift is next week, and Footnote is already watching you.

@track tavern
kind: job
name: Server at the Gilded Newt
skill: charm
place: gilded_newt
ranks: Server, Barkeep, Manager
pay: 19, 26, 34
due: 3
desc: Evening shifts behind the bar. Tips depend on charm; survival depends on remembering who ordered the spiced cider.
picked: You sign on at the Gilded Newt. The landlady shows you the cellar and the back door.

@track apothecary_clerk
kind: job
name: Apothecary Clerk
skill: alchemy
place: pell_apothecary
ranks: Clerk, Dispenser, Assistant Apothecary
pay: 12, 17, 22
due: 3
lead: pell
intro: pell_first_shift
desc: Counting drops and reading labels at Pell & Daughters. The wrong drawer is never just the wrong drawer.
picked: You sign on at Pell & Daughters. Pell shows you which drawers never to open.

@track broom_courier
kind: job
name: Broom Courier
skill: vigor
place: courier_loft
ranks: Runner, Courier, Chief Courier
pay: 19, 26, 34
due: 3
desc: Parcels, letters and the occasional live delivery, flown across the lake in all weathers.
picked: You sign on at the courier loft. They give you a satchel and a broom that pulls left.

# ---------------- Research internships (by application; design §7.5) ----------------

@track intern_royal_library
kind: internship
name: Royal Library Archives
skill: lore
pay: 18
place: royal_library_archives
desc: Cataloguing and research in the oldest archives of the realm.

@track intern_conclave
kind: internship
name: Conclave Laboratory
skill: arcana
pay: 18
place: conclave_laboratory
desc: Spell research with the Conclave of the Seven Towers. Prestigious; a faculty recommendation is expected.

@track intern_alchemists
kind: internship
name: Guild of Alchemists' Works
skill: alchemy
pay: 18
place: alchemists_works
desc: Industrial alchemy at the Guild's great works.

@track intern_expedition
kind: internship
name: Observatory Expedition
skill: lore
pay: 18
place: observatory_camp
desc: A summer of sky charts on a high plateau.

@track intern_field_station
kind: internship
name: Beastcraft Field Station
skill: vigor
pay: 18
place: field_station
desc: Tracking, tending and counting creatures on the moors.

@track intern_thornwick
kind: internship
name: Thornwick Exchange Lab
skill: charm
pay: 18
place: thornwick_lab
desc: An exchange placement at the rival academy's illusion laboratory.

@track intern_unseen_office
kind: internship
name: Office of Unseen Affairs
skill: guile
pay: 18
place: unseen_office
hidden: true
desc: By invitation only. Nobody applies to the Office of Unseen Affairs.

# ---------------- Thesis (year 4; design §7.6) ----------------

@track thesis
kind: thesis
name: Thesis
place: thesis_lab
due: 2
desc: A year-long research project with a faculty advisor, ending in a defence before a committee of three.
